description: flodl-hf head DDP validation vehicle (cooperative + managed tiers)
docker: cuda
# Cargo entry with a derived CLI (FdlArgs / parse_or_schema): `compile: true`
# lets fdl auto-probe the binary's own `--fdl-schema`, so `fdl hf-ddp --help`
# reflects the actual CLI — the binary is the single source of truth, no
# inline schema to drift. First `-h` after an fdl.yml change compiles once in
# the cuda container, then caches (.fdl/schema-cache/, gitignored).
compile: true
entry: cargo run --release --features cuda --
